{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Quickstart","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted"],"anchor":"Quickstart"},{"title":"How-to Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest"],"anchor":"How-to-Guides"},{"title":"Reference","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"anchor":"Reference"},{"title":"Explanation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ValueTranslation"],"anchor":"Explanation"},{"title":"Service Layer","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService"],"anchor":"Service-Layer"},{"title":"Testing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"],"anchor":"Testing"},{"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/SwiduxAnalytics","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/Swift"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":" is the bridge between Mixpanel’s iOS SDK and Swidux’s provider-agnostic analytics plugin. The plugin owns analytics state (opt-out flag, current screen, last-identified user) and converts your domain actions into typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" values; this package translates those events into Mixpanel SDK calls and maps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsValue"},{"type":"text","text":" into Mixpanel’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Properties"},{"type":"text","text":" payload."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two types ship in a single product:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that constructs and wraps a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelInstance"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — a recording actor for SwiftUI "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks and Swift Testing suites."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The flow:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","  → AnalyticsPlugin runs the mapper in afterReduce","  → mapper emits AnalyticsEvent(\"counter_added\", [\"amount\": .int(5)])","  → MixpanelAnalyticsService.track(_:) forwards to MixpanelInstance.track(event:properties:)","  → Mixpanel SDK queues the event and flushes per its own schedule"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin and the adapter stay decoupled: the plugin doesn’t know about Mixpanel, and the adapter doesn’t know about your action tree."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" internally so apps never need to ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" internally so apps never need to ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, build ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."